Package: omv-fnos-support
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: fnOS Storage Compat contributors <root@localhost>
Depends: base-files (>= 13), base-files (<< 14), openmediavault (>= 8), openmediavault (<< 9), linux-image-7.2.6-fnos2-amd64 (= 7.2.6-1~fnos13+2), linux-headers-7.2.6-fnos2-amd64 (= 7.2.6-1~fnos13+2), mdadm (>= 4.6-3~fnos13+1), mdadm (<< 4.7~), lvm2, e2fsprogs, kmod
Description: Community fnOS Basic storage compatibility for OMV 8
 Tracks a tested kernel and userspace combination for Debian 13 amd64 BIOS.
 Scope: single-member MD RAID1 with llbitmap, ordinary LVM and ext4.
 This dependency package does not assemble, mount, convert or share disks,
 change OMV configuration, or reboot. Normal dependency hooks still apply.
 Other layouts, platforms and Secure Boot are not validated.
